      "comment": "A description of the subscription plan. If the `trial` flag is `true`, it will show \"3 days free, then $1.99/month. Auto-renews until canceled.\" If the `trial` flag is `false`, it will show \"Auto renewable. Cancel anytime\". The argument is the string “year”, the string “month”, the string “week” or the string “period”.",
